        # EMOVI with _cfo=1 so the syscall-reroute dispatch (and any
        # other _cfv-driven optimization) can see the value at parse
        # time. Enum registration stores the raw value in _vecv_base and
        # sets the slot's GVECP presence flag; a flagged gvar is a fold
        # candidate. (6.6.8: at any var index — the 1024-slot cap is gone,
        # see util.cyr GVECP.)
